  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The configuration option to provide fedora with a namespace registry (fcrepo.namespace.registry) should be listed here:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA5x/Application+Configuration"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA5x/Application+Configuration",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Which should also link out to the more detailed description of namespace registries here:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA5x/Best+Practices+-+RDF+Namespaces"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA5x/Best+Practices+-+RDF+Namespaces",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This second document also needs to be updated to remove language stating that fedora automatically registers new namespaces.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "It may be helpful to list in one of these documents that there is a default namespace registry file used, which is located at ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-webapp/src/main/resources/namespaces.yml"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-webapp/src/main/resources/namespaces.yml",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
